--- !u!114 &375573092
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 375573089}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 27770be8b5c12ad4487a9868c55a11c1, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Cutscene
  director: {fileID: 476749893}
  id: asy_nurses
  once: 1
  skippable: 1
  letterbox: 1
  restoreCamera: 1
  clearScreenAtEnd: 1
  steps:
  - rid: 9117351028336624380
  - rid: 9117351028336624381
  - rid: 9117351028336624382
  - rid: 9117351028336624383
  - rid: 9117351028336624384
  - rid: 9117351028336624385
  - rid: 9117351028336624386
  - rid: 9117351028336624387
  - rid: 9117351028336624388
  - rid: 9117351028336624389
  - rid: 9117351028336624390
  - rid: 9117351028336624391
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds:
    - rid: 9117351028336624380
      type: {class: CameraCutStep, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        camera: {fileID: 1636411500}
    - rid: 9117351028336624381
      type: {class: SayStep, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        actor: {fileID: 1942213085}
        speaker: 
        textPt: Enfermaria. Vazia.
        textEn: Nurses station. Empty.
        audioPt: {fileID: 0}
        audioEn: {fileID: 0}
        wait: 1
        pauseAfter: 0.35
    - rid: 9117351028336624382
      type: {class: SayStep, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        actor: {fileID: 1942213085}
        speaker: 
        textPt: "Agora me explica uma coisa. \"Tr\xEAs dias. Entra como paciente,
          acha o arquivo, sai.\" Lembra? Foi o que voc\xEA me disse."
        textEn: Now explain something to me. "Three days. Go in as a patient, find
          the file, get out." Remember? Your words.
        audioPt: {fileID: 0}
        audioEn: {fileID: 0}
        wait: 1
        pauseAfter: 0.35
    - rid: 9117351028336624383
      type: {class: SayStep, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        actor: {fileID: 1942213085}
        speaker: 
        textPt: "Tr\xEAs dias viraram isso. Cad\xEA o resgate? Cad\xEA o plano B?"
        textEn: Three days turned into this. Where's the extraction? Where's plan
          B?
        audioPt: {fileID: 0}
        audioEn: {fileID: 0}
        wait: 1
        pauseAfter: 0.35
    - rid: 9117351028336624384
      type: {class: OperatorLineStep, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        textPt: "Eu n\xE3o sabia que isso ia acontecer."
        textEn: I didn't know this would happen.
        match: 0.6
        acceptAnything: 1
        showSubtitle: 1
        speakerPt: "VOC\xCA"
        speakerEn: YOU
    - rid: 9117351028336624385
      type: {class: SayStep, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        actor: {fileID: 1942213085}
        speaker: 
        textPt: "Voc\xEA nunca sabe. Esse \xE9 o problema."
        textEn: You never know. That's the problem.
        audioPt: {fileID: 0}
        audioEn: {fileID: 0}
        wait: 1
        pauseAfter: 0.35
    - rid: 9117351028336624386
      type: {class: WaitStep, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        seconds: 1.2
    - rid: 9117351028336624387
      type: {class: SayStep, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        actor: {fileID: 1942213085}
        speaker: 
        textPt: "...T\xE1. Brigar n\xE3o vai me tirar daqui."
        textEn: ...Fine. Fighting won't get me out of here.
        audioPt: {fileID: 0}
        audioEn: {fileID: 0}
        wait: 1
        pauseAfter: 0.35
    - rid: 9117351028336624388
      type: {class: SayStep, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        actor: {fileID: 1942213085}
        speaker: 
        textPt: "O mapa na parede: a sa\xEDda \xE9 pela escada, depois da guarita.
          E do lado da guarita tem o arsenal."
        textEn: 'The map on the wall: the way out is the stairwell, past the guard
          post. And the armory is right next to it.'
        audioPt: {fileID: 0}
        audioEn: {fileID: 0}
        wait: 1
        pauseAfter: 0.35
    - rid: 9117351028336624389
      type: {class: SayStep, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        actor: {fileID: 1942213085}
        speaker: 
        textPt: "At\xE9 l\xE1... aquela faca na maca serve."
        textEn: Until then... that knife on the gurney will do.
        audioPt: {fileID: 0}
        audioEn: {fileID: 0}
        wait: 1
        pauseAfter: 0.35
    - rid: 9117351028336624390
      type: {class: ThoughtStep, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        textPt: "Itens: \"pega a faca\". Armas: \"saca a faca\", \"guarda a arma\".
          Ela s\xF3 usa o que tiver pegado."
        textEn: 'Items: "pick up the knife". Weapons: "draw the knife", "put it away".
          She only uses what she has picked up.'
        wait: 1
        pauseAfter: 0.2
    - rid: 9117351028336624391
      type: {class: ThoughtStep, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        textPt: "O mapa das c\xE2meras (Tab) mostra as salas. As portas de seguran\xE7a,
          quem abre sou eu, por ele."
        textEn: The camera map (Tab) shows the rooms. The security doors are mine
          to open, from there.
        wait: 1
        pauseAfter: 0.2
