  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Examinable
  key: x_bed
  linesEn:
  - The bed I woke up on. Bolted to the floor, so nobody uses it as a weapon.
  - Three nights on that thing. My back's going to make me pay for it.
  linesPt:
  - "A cama onde eu acordei. Parafusada no ch\xE3o, pra ningu\xE9m usar de arma."
  - "Tr\xEAs noites nisso. Minhas costas v\xE3o me cobrar."
  clipsEn: []
  clipsPt: []
  standPoint: {fileID: 0}
  standDistance: 1.1
  seenFlag: 
