  key: x_desk
  linesEn:
  - Patient files... mine's here. "Patient 2716. Persecutory delusions." At least
    the cover held.
  - '"Believes she is being watched at all times." ...Well.'
  linesPt:
  - "Prontu\xE1rios... o meu t\xE1 aqui. \"Paciente 2716. Del\xEDrios persecut\xF3rios.\"
    Pelo menos o disfarce colou."
  - "\"Acredita que est\xE1 sendo observada o tempo todo.\" ...Pois \xE9."
  clipsEn: []
  clipsPt: []
  standPoint: {fileID: 0}
  standDistance: 1.1
  seenFlag: 
